    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68460" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόν-αυλος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>player on the single flute</i>, <i><span class="en">
